*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

